                        <button id="playAudioPromptBtn" class="btn-pop bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-base shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mx-auto">
                            <span>🔊</span> Ouvir Som Novamente
